      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, mwana womundu, rumbula nofukula Gogu, nosunga ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Lola, ekhufukula, iwe Gogu, omukhulundu waRoshi, Meshekhu, naTubali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndalakhushiukhasia, nikhwilusia, nikhutikulusia okhurula khushihesi shienotsi, nikhwimilila mbu oseere tsingulu tsiaIsiraeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndalakhupa obuyingobwo, burule mumukhonokwo mukhasi, nindakasia ebiselebio birule mumukhonokwo musaatsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olakwisibwa khungulu tsiaIsiraeli, iwe netsing'andatsio tsiosi, nende tsimbia etsia olaba noli ninatsio; ndalakhuhaana khumanyonyi amalii ketsimbia tsiosi, nokhutsisolo tsinabulimo, mbu oliibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olakwisibwa mubulimo ebulafu; okhuba nisie ouboolile, Omwami NYASAYE aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalaruma omulilo khuMagogu, nokhubeenabo abamenya shisale khunguku tsieinyanza; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalamanyisia eliira lianje litakatifu hakari wabandu banje Isiraeli; kata shindalafuchiilila eliira lianje litakatifu okhwonoonibwa khandi ta; mana amahanga kalamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI, Omutakatifu muIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, keetsanga, ne kaleekhola; nolwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola; yino niyo induukho tsana eya ndaboolakhwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamenyanga mumataala kaIsiraeli balarula nibabwana omulilo kwebimanulwa nibabisamba, mbu tsingabo nebikhumba, obuyingo nebisele, tsindabushi namafumo; nibio ebilaba tsikhwi tsiabwe emiyika musaafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata shibalarenyanga tsikhwi mubulimo, kata okhutsirema mumutsuru ta; okhuba baleekhoonyelanga ebimanulwa tsana khulwa omulilo; balayaayanga abo ababayaaya, nibabanyaka abo ababanyaka; nilwo olwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khunduukho eyo ndalaheelesia Gogu eshianyi shieshilindwa muIsiraeli, mwibanda liAbabiri, ebukwe weinyanza; shileekalila ababiri; ebweneyo balamuyabila Gogu halala nobunji bwabandube; mana balalilanga mbu Libanda liaHamonigogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeinzu yaIsiraeli balamala emiesi musaafu nibabayabilanga, okhusiiya eshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abandu bosi beshialo balabayabiIanga; ne khulwako balafuma khunyanga olwa ndalalolosia oluyali lwanje; nolwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balahandiika abandu okhubiranga mushialo okhuyabila ababiri abashitong'a khushialo, okhushilabia; ne olunyuma Iwemiesi musaafu balakhaaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababiranga mushialo balabira, ne omundu yesi khubo naba nalola likumba liomundu, alasinjisiayo eshilolelo, okhuula olwa abayabili balaba nibaliyabiile mwibanda liaHamoni-gogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi litaala elo lilalangwa mbu Hamona. Nindio balasiiya eshialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, mwana womundu, kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Boolela ama-nyonyi ketsimbia tsiosi, nende buli solo inabulimo, ori Khung'aane, mwitse; mwikhung'aasie tsimbeka tsiosi khumusango kwanje okwa emumalila, omusango omukhongo khungulu siaIsiraeli, mbu mulie inyama nimunywa amabanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulalia inyama yabalulu, nimunywa amabanga kabakhulundu beshialo; nakamamiiku, namakondi, netsimbusi, netsing'ombe, biosi ebineefu biaBashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulalia amasinya nimwikura, nimunywa amabanga nimumeela, khumusango kwanje okwa emumaliile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumeesa yanje muleekura tsifarasi namakaari, nabalulu, nabandu bosi belihe; nolwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalara oluyali lwanje hakari wamahanga; mana amahanga kosi kalalola akobukhalachi aka ndalaba nikholile, nomukhono kwanje okwa ndareele khubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abeinzu yaIsiraeli balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe, okhurula khunyanga eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga nako kalamanya mbu abeinzu yaIsiraeli baarwa khulwa obumayaanu bwabwe; okhuba ba'khaya, nasi nimbabisa tsimoni tsianje; kho ndabahaana mumakhono kabasuku babwe, nibakwisibwa bosi nolukanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukaali bwabwe nobukhayi bwabwe shinga olwa bwali, nindio ndabakholela endio; ndababisa tsimoni tsianje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboolaj mbu Bulaano ndalakalusia tsikhabi tsiaYakobo, nimbeela tsimbabasi inzu yaIsiraeli yosi; ndalaba neimbalikha khulwa eliira lianje litakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleebilila tsisoni tsiabwe, nobukhayi bwabwe bwosi obwa ba'khayanga, olwa balamenya mushialo shiabwe shisale, omundu yesi narabariisinjia ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
